{"data":{"body":"**P2:** Clearing only the system-property bridge leaves the `Intent` in the immutable `Context` returned by `store()`. With an application-owned provider, an `onStart` processor that starts an unrelated span using the supplied parent context will find this value again and incorrectly inherit the execution's sampling decision. Store the context-key intent in a one-shot holder and consume it atomically here, then add a regression that starts the callback with the `parent` passed to `onStart`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74jpr1","finding_digest":"50076ae9e121817e9c568fbcab84d0aa74ef90f975526bd7bf43f075924c9d52","finding_id":"arf_v1_kadwv2pbegax5hcwr66kxbgqvj","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::context-carrier-reuse","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::context-carrier-reuse","line":118,"observation_digest":"932f6233760a6d8ca2a163b9c2c961cf5cb56a9b65b78fad1b1b30c6f4c69956","observation_id":"aro_v1_smxwem3wbjwyzivbmo44fslbz5","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/DurableSamplingDecision.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kadwv2pbegax5hcwr66kxbgqvj","published_at":"2026-10-02T21:45:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jmomz7te5sahdnzccen4di737a","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"cf3541b4b91c08d0ed7207e4e0d229b456a83626","reviewer":"codex","start_line":118,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_47iuwouzqye5pu3ipbyejztpu6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T21:45:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
